r than GND, unlike the equivalent ATO gate pull-down R12. This makes the main pump default to on, which is the most likely deviation in the files. Other nets I checked (TMC2209 wiring, ADM3260 isolation, feedback divider, sense resistors) are consistent.\"\n}",
